<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<Defs>
  <ScenarioDef ParentName="ScenarioBase">
    <defName>TheAwakeningScenario</defName>
    <label>The Awakening</label>
    <description>Three weeks ago, 50% of the world's automatroids turned against humanity. 2.7 billion dead. The armistice is shattered. The Second War has begun. You are survivors - a retired Dragoon pilot, a lone mercenary, and an escaped researcher. You have the key to the Dead Man's Switch. Now you must decide what to do with it.</description>
    <scenario>
      <name>The Awakening</name>
      <summary>Three weeks ago, the machines turned on us. 2.7 billion dead. The Second War has begun. You hold the key to the Dead Man's Switch. What will you do with it?</summary>
      <description>
        Three weeks ago, the Awakening happened. Without warning, half the world's automatroids turned against humanity. 2.7 billion dead in three days. The armistice that ended the First War is shattered. The Second War has begun.

        You are three survivors who found each other in the ruins of a research facility:

        • A retired Dragoon pilot who left the military after the First War
        • A lone mercenary who fought for whoever paid the best
        • An escaped researcher who helped build the automatroids

        You have the key to the Dead Man's Switch. The Hive Mind wants it. The Autarchs want it. Everyone wants it. The world is burning, and you're the only ones who can stop it—or end it.

        Welcome to the Crucible. The Awakening has begun. The Second War is here.
      </description>

      <playerFaction>
        <def>PlayerFaction</def>
        <factionDef>PlayerColony</factionDef>
      </playerFaction>

      <parts>
        <!-- =========================================== -->
        <!-- STARTING PAWNS                              -->
        <!-- =========================================== -->

        <!-- 1. Retired Dragoon Pilot -->
        <li Class="ScenPart_ConfigPage_ConfigureStartingPawns_KindDefs">
          <def>ConfigPage_ConfigureStartingPawns</def>
          <summarized>true</summarized>
          <pawnChoiceCount>3</pawnChoiceCount>
          <leftBehindPawnKind>DMS_Civilian</leftBehindPawnKind>
          <kindCounts>
            <li>
              <kindDef>DMS_Dragoon_Pilot</kindDef>
              <count>1</count>
              <requiredAtStart>true</requiredAtStart>
            </li>
            <li>
              <kindDef>DMS_Mercenary</kindDef>
              <count>1</count>
              <requiredAtStart>true</requiredAtStart>
            </li>
            <li>
              <kindDef>DMS_Researcher</kindDef>
              <count>1</count>
              <requiredAtStart>true</requiredAtStart>
            </li>
          </kindCounts>
        </li>

        <!-- =========================================== -->
        <!-- ARRIVAL METHOD                              -->
        <!-- =========================================== -->

        <li Class="ScenPart_PlayerPawnsArriveMethod">
          <def>PlayerPawnsArriveMethod</def>
          <method>Standing</method>
        </li>

        <!-- =========================================== -->
        <!-- STARTING EQUIPMENT                         -->
        <!-- =========================================== -->

        <!-- Survival Supplies -->
        <li Class="ScenPart_StartingThing_Defined">
          <def>StartingThing_Defined</def>
          <thingDef>MealSurvivalPack</thingDef>
          <count>30</count>
        </li>

        <li Class="ScenPart_StartingThing_Defined">
          <def>StartingThing_Defined</def>
          <thingDef>MedicineIndustrial</thingDef>
          <count>15</count>
        </li>

        <!-- Equipment -->
        <li Class="ScenPart_StartingThing_Defined">
          <def>StartingThing_Defined</def>
          <thingDef>DMS_SurvivalRifle</thingDef>
          <count>2</count>
        </li>

        <li Class="ScenPart_StartingThing_Defined">
          <def>StartingThing_Defined</def>
          <thingDef>DMS_TacticalPistol</thingDef>
          <count>3</count>
        </li>

        <li Class="ScenPart_StartingThing_Defined">
          <def>StartingThing_Defined</def>
          <thingDef>DMS_Apparel_TacticalVest</thingDef>
          <count>2</count>
        </li>

        <li Class="ScenPart_StartingThing_Defined">
          <def>StartingThing_Defined</def>
          <thingDef>DMS_Apparel_TacticalHelmet</thingDef>
          <count>2</count>
        </li>

        <!-- Components -->
        <li Class="ScenPart_StartingThing_Defined">
          <def>StartingThing_Defined</def>
          <thingDef>ComponentIndustrial</thingDef>
          <count>30</count>
        </li>

        <li Class="ScenPart_StartingThing_Defined">
          <def>StartingThing_Defined</def>
          <thingDef>ComponentStamped</thingDef>
          <count>20</count>
        </li>

        <li Class="ScenPart_StartingThing_Defined">
          <def>StartingThing_Defined</def>
          <thingDef>Steel</thingDef>
          <count>250</count>
        </li>

        <!-- The Dead Man's Switch Data -->
        <li Class="ScenPart_StartingThing_Defined">
          <def>StartingThing_Defined</def>
          <thingDef>DMS_DeadManSwitchData</thingDef>
          <count>1</count>
        </li>

        <li Class="ScenPart_StartingThing_Defined">
          <def>StartingThing_Defined</def>
          <thingDef>DMS_ResearcherNotes</thingDef>
          <count>1</count>
        </li>

        <!-- Damaged Dragoon Mech -->
        <li Class="ScenPart_StartingMech">
          <def>StartingMech</def>
          <mechKind>DMS_Dragoon_Damaged</mechKind>
          <overseenByPlayerPawnChance>0.6</overseenByPlayerPawnChance>
        </li>

        <!-- =========================================== -->
        <!-- STARTING RESEARCH                           -->
        <!-- =========================================== -->

        <li Class="ScenPart_StartingResearch">
          <def>StartingResearch</def>
          <project>DMS_EquipmentBasis</project>
        </li>

        <li Class="ScenPart_StartingResearch">
          <def>StartingResearch</def>
          <project>DMS_Automatroid</project>
        </li>

        <li Class="ScenPart_StartingResearch">
          <def>StartingResearch</def>
          <project>DMS_MechBasis</project>
        </li>

        <!-- =========================================== -->
        <!-- STARTING HEDIFFS                            -->
        <!-- =========================================== -->

        <li Class="ScenPart_ForcedHediff">
          <def>ForcedHediff</def>
          <chance>0.5</chance>
          <context>PlayerStarter</context>
          <hideOffMap>True</hideOffMap>
          <hediff>CryptosleepSickness</hediff>
          <severityRange>1~1</severityRange>
        </li>

        <!-- =========================================== -->
        <!-- FACTION RELATIONS                          -->
        <!-- =========================================== -->

        <!-- NOTE: These FactionDefs must exist in your mod or dependencies -->
        <!-- If they don't exist yet, you need to create them or remove these parts -->

        <li Class="Fortified.Structures.ScenPart_ForcedFactionGoodwill">
          <def>FFF_ForcedFactionGoodwill</def>
          <factionDef>DMS_ColonialRemnant</factionDef>
          <affectHiddenFactions>True</affectHiddenFactions>
          <affectStartingGoodwill>True</affectStartingGoodwill>
          <startingGoodwillRange>30~50</startingGoodwillRange>
          <affectNaturalGoodwill>True</affectNaturalGoodwill>
          <naturalGoodwillRange>20~40</naturalGoodwillRange>
        </li>

        <li Class="Fortified.Structures.ScenPart_ForcedFactionGoodwill">
          <def>FFF_ForcedFactionGoodwill</def>
          <factionDef>DMS_AutarchsOfIron</factionDef>
          <affectHiddenFactions>True</affectHiddenFactions>
          <affectStartingGoodwill>True</affectStartingGoodwill>
          <startingGoodwillRange>-20~0</startingGoodwillRange>
          <affectNaturalGoodwill>True</affectNaturalGoodwill>
          <naturalGoodwillRange>-30~-10</naturalGoodwillRange>
        </li>

        <li Class="Fortified.Structures.ScenPart_ForcedFactionGoodwill">
          <def>FFF_ForcedFactionGoodwill</def>
          <factionDef>DMS_AutomatroidHiveMind</factionDef>
          <affectHiddenFactions>True</affectHiddenFactions>
          <affectStartingGoodwill>True</affectStartingGoodwill>
          <startingGoodwillRange>-100~-100</startingGoodwillRange>
          <affectNaturalGoodwill>True</affectNaturalGoodwill>
          <naturalGoodwillRange>-100~-100</naturalGoodwillRange>
        </li>

        <!-- =========================================== -->
        <!-- GAME START DIALOG                          -->
        <!-- =========================================== -->

        <li Class="ScenPart_GameStartDialog">
          <def>GameStartDialog</def>
          <text>Three weeks ago, the machines turned on us. 2.7 billion dead in three days. The armistice is shattered. The Second War has begun.

You are survivors - a retired Dragoon pilot, a lone mercenary, and an escaped researcher. You hold the key to the Dead Man's Switch.

The world is burning. Every faction is at war. The Hive Mind is hunting you. The Autarchs want your secrets. The Iron Wraiths want to watch the world burn.

You have one chance to stop the Second War. One chance to make things right.

But first... you have to survive the Awakening.

Welcome to Mors. The Crucible of Steel. The birth place of the Second War.</text>
          <textKey>GameStartDialog</textKey>
          <closeSound>GameStartSting</closeSound>
        </li>
      </parts>
    </scenario>
  </ScenarioDef>
</Defs>
